ure reproduction of the boundary.\u001b[13X\r\n  What it does not prove: production rollout. The unit converted here\u001b[9X\r\n  is proved by a bounded canary and runs in shadow; the part running\u001b[10X\r\n  continuously in production is result delivery and acknowledgement.\u001b[10X\u001b[30;78H\u001b[1K\r\n  Both arms are one result. Arm 1 passes even against a resolver that\u001b[9X\r\n  mints a duplicate session on every call, because its retry resumes\u001b[10X\r\n  from a checkpoint and never re-resolves. Only arm 2 shows that a\u001b[12X\r\n  duplicate launch was prevented. Do not present arm 1 on its own."]
